flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Open Student Information System]
    B --> C[/Enter Username and Password/]
    C --> D{Login Successful?}

    D -- No --> E[Display Error Message]
    E --> C

    D -- Yes --> F[Display Dashboard]
    F --> G[/Select a Function/]

    G --> H{Choose Task}

    H --> I[Manage Student Records]
    H --> J[Record Attendance]
    H --> K[Enter Grades]
    H --> L[Generate Reports]

    I --> M[Save Changes]
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> N[Display Report]

    M --> O[Display Success Message]
    N --> O

    O --> P{Perform Another Task?}

    P -- Yes --> G
    P -- No --> Q[Logout]

    Q --> R([End])